/* No radio is named in the DT (image ccpa-baseline-none.zimg). uart3 stays a plain tty (/dev/ttymxc2),
 * usdhc1 is described but its driver is a rootfs module that only `radio up` loads; Wi-Fi works with
 * this image, Bluetooth needs the chip's own image (or btattach, UNVERIFIED). */
